# The hop in front of every module the playground composes: each call is
# decided against the method or route it is for, and the hop signs an admission
# for exactly that call with its own seed (hop-signing/SEED, generated for
# authority/hop alone). The document store serves gRPC (UPSTREAM_DOCUMENTS) and, on the same
# listener family, Connect (CONNECT_UPSTREAM_DOCUMENTS: the page's calls, decided
# by method and reaching the store's own listener stamped). The model gateway
# serves gRPC (UPSTREAM_MODEL): the store's generated embedding client, when a
# composition selects the installed provider, calls it here. ENDPOINT is the
# hop's own gRPC address.
MODULES=documents,model
ENDPOINT=${endpoint:authority/hop/grpc}
UPSTREAM_DOCUMENTS=${endpoint:documents/documents/grpc}
CONNECT_UPSTREAM_DOCUMENTS=${endpoint:documents/documents/grpc}
UPSTREAM_MODEL=${endpoint:model/model/grpc}
